You can add foot note to the bottom of the table using tfoot="foot note here", it is one of the htmlTable option.
Please see

https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/htmlTable/vignettes/tables.html#the-knitrkable-function

for detail.

Jathine

 <https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/htmlTable/vignettes/tables.html#the-knitrkable-function>
